==Notes==
*Added in the [[expansion pack]]s.
*This feat does not replace [[expertise]], allowing a character with both feats to choose the lesser attack penalty of ''expertise'' instead of the larger AC bonus of ''improved expertise''.
*By default, NWN allows spellcasting while using ''improved expertise''. However, [[BioWare]] included a switch to disable it via scripting using [[spellhook]]ing.
**Under the default behavior, this can be a useful feat for casters who do not make attacks, as they will gain the AC benefit at effectively no cost.
*This combat mode cannot be used while wielding a [[ranged weapon]].